    {
      "key": "ta40c50343c36c0bc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage difference = Execution Price − Expected Price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">滑点差额 = 执行价格 - 预期价格</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t45c83378ee915ad0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For a currency pair where 0.0001 represents one pip, the execution difference is 4 pips.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于 0.0001 代表 一 点的货币对，执行差异为 4 点。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te3c249027c95b53e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Because a buyer paid a higher price than expected, this represents </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">4 pips of negative slippage</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">由于买家支付的价格高于预期，这代表</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">4个点的负滑点</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">。</span>"
    },
