      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">更优惠</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t41ed93de2831d9d2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Less favorable</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">不太有利</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t081a491883b12d70",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage type</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">滑点类型</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t571e3ebc6c29b162",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Outcome 1: Positive Slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">结果 1：正滑点</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t96ff8894b54b5c6e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The trader therefore receives a price 3 pips better than expected.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">因此，交易者获得的价格比预期有利3点。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4f65195571488869",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Outcome 2: Negative Slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">结果 2：负滑点</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t88e65f6bbbed8363",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The buyer receives a price 4 pips worse than expected, creating negative slippage.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">买家收到的价格比预期差 4 点，造成负滑点。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tda3718b8fa2e2c14",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The examples show why the </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">meaning of slippage</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> cannot be understood only from the size of the price difference.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">这些示例说明，</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">滑点的含义</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">不能仅根据价格差异的大小来理解。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8169a695652588c9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Does High Slippage Mean?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">高滑点意味着什么？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc8ce25f9ad687445",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">An order is large relative to available liquidity</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">订单相对于可用流动性来说较大</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf518f68125738021",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Execution is delayed</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">执行被延迟</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3002e6903179ce62",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">High slippage does not have one universal numerical threshold.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">高滑点没有一个通用的数字阈值。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t83da3e863a6bd5d2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What may be considered unusually large for one instrument could be normal for another because tick size, volatility, liquidity, and trading conditions differ.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">由于最小变动价位、波动性、流动性和交易条件各不相同，对某一金融工具而言异常大的滑点，对另一金融工具而言可能属于正常范围。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t67bccb832cd30bcd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Does the Execution Model Affect Slippage?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">执行模型如何影响滑点？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5a79465170964a0f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Execution policy</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">执行策略</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "taf341fe633dc5ef8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Liquidity arrangements</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">流动性安排</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9c67339522be1fd7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Requote or rejection rules</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">重新报价或拒绝规则</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc2e0b47765618397",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Order-routing structure</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">订单路由结构</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t01ccc0938b7b07bf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Actual execution records</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">实际执行记录</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t943bc3f0de6555c8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Searching for the “lowest slippage broker” without considering these factors can oversimplify execution quality.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在不考虑这些因素的情况下寻找“滑点最低的经纪商”可能会过度简化执行质量。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t792f4f026539ed8e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Can Traders Manage Slippage Risk?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">交易者如何管理滑点风险？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t64aaea8d9ad1f11f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">However, this creates a trade-off.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">但是，这会产生一个权衡。</span>"
    }
  ]
